          "type": "AnnotationPage",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-announcements-notice-board.iiif.json/note/1",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Open vuthis.com on the TV or projector</h3><p>Open vuthis.com in the display browser. For a projector, use its browser or the computer already connected to it. Keep the connection code on screen.</p><p>The screen is ready for a controller.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-announcements-notice-board.html#step-1\">Follow this step in Turn a TV into a Digital Notice Board: Interactive Walkthrough</a></p>"
              },
              "target": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-announcements-notice-board.iiif.json/canvas/1"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-announcements-notice-board.iiif.json/note/2",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Connect your phone, tablet or laptop</h3><p>Scan the screen QR code with your phone. On a laptop or tablet, open vuthis.com/r and enter the screen code. Both devices need internet; they can use different networks.</p><p>The content controls are on your device.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-announcements-notice-board.html#step-2\">Follow this step in Turn a TV into a Digital Notice Board: Interactive Walkthrough</a></p>"
              },
              "target": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-announcements-notice-board.iiif.json/canvas/1"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-announcements-notice-board.iiif.json/note/3",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Choose Announcement and write the title</h3><p>Choose Announcement. Give the notice a short title such as Session change, Welcome or Today at reception.</p><p>The main point is immediately clear.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-announcements-notice-board.html#step-3\">Follow this step in Turn a TV into a Digital Notice Board: Interactive Walkthrough</a></p>"
              },
              "target": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-announcements-notice-board.iiif.json/canvas/1"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
